        <definition>void llvm::MachineDomTreeUpdater::validateDeleteBB</definition>
        <argsstring>(MachineBasicBlock *DelBB)</argsstring>
        <name>validateDeleteBB</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::MachineDomTreeUpdater::validateDeleteBB</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_basic_block" kindref="compound">MachineBasicBlock</ref> *</type>
          <declname>DelBB</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>First remove all the instructions of DelBB and then make sure DelBB has a valid terminator instruction which is necessary to have when DelBB still has to be inside of its parent <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref> while awaiting deletion under Lazy <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_generic_dom_tree_updater_1a2655b89361decf2c1493792dc14e5a56" kindref="member">UpdateStrategy</ref> to prevent other routines from asserting the state of the IR is inconsistent. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Assert if DelBB is nullptr or has predecessors. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
